    <details data-faq data-faq-id="delivery-no-local-store"><summary>Can adult-use cannabis be delivered to a town without a retail store?</summary><p>Yes, an authorized licensee may deliver to an eligible destination even when the municipality has not authorized a local adult-use store. The municipality may regulate time, place, and manner but may not prohibit the authorized delivery or require a separate delivery permit.</p></details>
